## Health System Overview

### General Health
- Player has a general health pool (0-100)
- `ReduceGeneralHealth(amount)` - **DANGEROUS** - directly reduces HP
- General health regenerates over time if injuries are treated

### Body Damage
Access via: `player:getBodyDamage()`

Key methods:
```lua
local bodyDamage = player:getBodyDamage()
bodyDamage:ReduceGeneralHealth(amount)  -- Direct HP damage (use sparingly!)
bodyDamage:getOverallBodyHealth()       -- Get current health
bodyDamage:getBodyPart(BodyPartType.X)  -- Get specific body part
bodyDamage:getBodyParts()               -- Get all body parts (ArrayList)
```

---

## Body Parts

### Body Part Types (BodyPartType enum)
```lua
BodyPartType.Hand_L         -- Left Hand
BodyPartType.Hand_R         -- Right Hand
BodyPartType.ForeArm_L      -- Left Forearm
BodyPartType.ForeArm_R      -- Right Forearm
BodyPartType.UpperArm_L     -- Left Upper Arm
BodyPartType.UpperArm_R     -- Right Upper Arm
BodyPartType.Torso_Lower    -- Lower Torso
BodyPartType.Torso_Upper    -- Upper Torso
BodyPartType.Head           -- Head
BodyPartType.Neck           -- Neck
BodyPartType.Groin          -- Groin
BodyPartType.UpperLeg_L     -- Left Thigh
BodyPartType.UpperLeg_R     -- Right Thigh
BodyPartType.LowerLeg_L     -- Left Shin
BodyPartType.LowerLeg_R     -- Right Shin
BodyPartType.Foot_L         -- Left Foot
BodyPartType.Foot_R         -- Right Foot
BodyPartType.Back           -- Back
```

### Accessing Body Parts
```lua
-- Direct access
local hand = player:getBodyDamage():getBodyPart(BodyPartType.Hand_L)

-- Iterate all body parts
local bodyParts = player:getBodyDamage():getBodyParts()
for i = 0, BodyPartType.ToIndex(BodyPartType.MAX) - 1 do
    local bodyPart = bodyParts:get(i)
    local partType = bodyPart:getType()
end
```

---

## Injury Types

### Severity Scale (Lightest to Most Severe)

| Injury | Bleeds? | HP Drain | Treatment | Notes |
|--------|---------|----------|-----------|-------|
| Scratch | Minimal | None | Bandage optional | Heals on its own |
| Cut | Light | None | Bandage recommended | Heals with time |
| Deep Wound | Heavy | Indirect | Requires stitches + bandage | Can be fatal if untreated |
| Bite | Heavy | None* | Bandage | *Zombie = infection = death |
| Fracture | No | None | Splint | Affects movement |
| Burn | Variable | None | Bandage | Depends on severity |
| Bullet Wound | Heavy | None | Surgery + bandage | Bullet must be removed |
| Glass Wound | Heavy | None | Surgery + bandage | Glass must be removed |

### Important Distinction
- **Scratches/Cuts/Wounds** = Physical injuries, treatable
- **Infection (zombie)** = Death sentence (unless disabled in sandbox)
- **Wound Infection** = Treatable bacterial infection from dirty bandages

---

## Applying Injuries

### Scratches (Lightest)
```lua
local hand = player:getBodyDamage():getBodyPart(BodyPartType.Hand_L)

-- Standard scratch
hand:setScratched(true, false)  -- (scratched, fromInfection)

-- Tool/weapon scratch (farming, opening cans, etc.)
hand:SetScratchedWeapon(true)

-- Set scratch healing time (0 = fresh)
hand:setScratchTime(0)
```

### Cuts
```lua
local hand = player:getBodyDamage():getBodyPart(BodyPartType.Hand_L)

hand:setCut(true)
hand:setCutTime(0)  -- 0 = fresh cut
```

### Bleeding
```lua
-- Set bleeding duration (higher = longer bleed)
hand:setBleedingTime(0.2)   -- Tiny bleed (scratch)
hand:setBleedingTime(5)     -- Light bleed (cut)
hand:setBleedingTime(10)    -- Moderate bleed
hand:setBleedingTime(20)    -- Heavy bleed (deep wound)
```

### Deep Wounds
```lua
-- Auto-generate (sets bleeding automatically)
hand:generateDeepWound()

-- OR manual
hand:setDeepWounded(true)
hand:setDeepWoundTime(50)
hand:setBleedingTime(20)
```

### Glass/Shard Wounds
```lua
hand:generateDeepShardWound()  -- Deep wound + embedded glass
```

### Burns
```lua
hand:setBurnTime(50)  -- Higher = more severe
```

### Fractures
```lua
hand:setFractureTime(21)  -- Days to heal (in-game time)
```

### Bullet Wounds
```lua
hand:setHaveBullet(true, 0)  -- (hasBullet, bulletDepth)
```

### Bites (Zombie)
```lua
hand:SetBitten(true)
hand:SetInfected(true)  -- This kills the player (unless sandbox disabled)
```

---

## Checking Injuries

### Boolean Checks
```lua
local hand = player:getBodyDamage():getBodyPart(BodyPartType.Hand_L)

hand:scratched()        -- Is scratched?
hand:isCut()            -- Is cut?
hand:bleeding()         -- Is bleeding?
hand:isDeepWounded()    -- Has deep wound?
hand:deepWounded()      -- Alternative deep wound check
hand:bitten()           -- Was bitten?
hand:isInfectedWound()  -- Has wound infection?
hand:isBurnt()          -- Is burned?
hand:haveBullet()       -- Has bullet lodged?
hand:haveGlass()        -- Has glass lodged?
hand:bandaged()         -- Is bandaged?
hand:stitched()         -- Is stitched?
hand:HasInjury()        -- Has ANY injury?
```

### Duration/Severity Checks
```lua
hand:getScratchTime()     -- Scratch duration remaining
hand:getBleedingTime()    -- Bleeding duration remaining
hand:getDeepWoundTime()   -- Deep wound duration remaining
hand:getBurnTime()        -- Burn duration remaining
hand:getFractureTime()    -- Fracture duration remaining
```

---

## Healing & Treatment

### Remove Injuries
```lua
-- Remove scratch
hand:setScratched(false, true)
hand:setScratchTime(0)

-- Remove cut
hand:setCut(false)
hand:setCutTime(0)

-- Remove deep wound
hand:setDeepWounded(false)
hand:setDeepWoundTime(0)
hand:setBleedingTime(0)

-- Full heal (removes everything)
hand:RestoreToFullHealth()
```

### Bandaging (done via items, but for reference)
```lua
hand:bandaged()  -- Check if bandaged
```

